# Sidecars & dependency pinning

- Every downloaded archive must have a pinned SHA-256 in
  `scripts/dependencies.sha256`, verified from two independent upstream sources
  before bumping. `download-deps.sh` refuses unpinned or mismatched archives.
- Do not commit downloaded binaries. `src-tauri/binaries/*` is gitignored except
  the README.
- **Generated — do not hand-edit:** `src-tauri/binaries/README.md` and
  `src-tauri/resources/licenses/THIRD_PARTY.md` are written by `download-deps.sh`.
  Edit the script's heredocs instead.
- Sidecars are staged as `<name>-<target-triple>` (plus a triple-less convenience
  copy). `obfs4proxy` is an alias of `lyrebird`.
- Bump versions via `TOR_BROWSER_VERSION` / `SINGBOX_VERSION` and update the hash
  manifest in the same change.
